# ── PRODUCTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Loaded automatically by `vite build` / `pnpm build` (Vite mode = "production").
# SAFE TO COMMIT: every VITE_* var is inlined into the browser bundle, so nothing
# secret can live here by definition. Values are public.

# ⚠️ NOT SET YET. The new NestJS backend is not deployed to a production host —
# https://shipguard.app still serves the OLD Remix app, which has none of the
# /api/v1 admin routes, so pointing here at shipguard.app produces 404s on every call.
#
# Set this to the new backend's public HTTPS host when it is deployed. Must be https://:
# the admin console is served over HTTPS on GitHub Pages, so an http:// API is blocked
# as mixed content.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://backend.charming-wood.xyz
